        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/thompson1917-t1917-025-4> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) thompson/claims/t1917-025_spicules-geodetics.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real unspecified organism specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    schema:about "unspecified organism" ;
    pk:context "script(s): None/blob/main/thompson/claims/t1917-025_spicules-geodetics.py; output: docs/media/t1917_025_spicules_geodetics_comparison.png; organism: unspecified organism; environment: n/a; other sources: On Growth and Form (1st ed.), Ch. IX-X <https://archive.org/details/ongrowthform1917thom>" ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-025-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-025-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-025-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-025-overall>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-025-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-025-repro-package>,
